  "text": "Platinum Price in the 2010s\nBetween the first (2010-01-29) and last (2019-12-30) monthly observations available for the 2010s, the LBMA platinum price went from $1,512 to $952 — a decline of 37% — with a sampled high of $1,845 (Aug 2011) and a sampled low of $788 (Dec 2018).\nYears in the 2010s\n2010\n2011\n2012\n2013\n2014\n2015\n2016\n2017\n2018\n2019\nSee today's live platinum price on the\nspot dashboard\n, or\nshop platinum bullion\nat Bullion Trading LLC.\nData retrieved 2026-09-26. Latest observation for this metal: 2026-09-25. The current month is provisional.\nSources, sampling and calculation methodology\n.\nPrepared by the\nBullion Trading LLC editorial team\n.",
